WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.145 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.225 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:44.265 --> 01:46.505
Welcome back to the palace, Your Majesty.

5
01:46.585 --> 01:47.705
ETERNAL SPLENDOR

6
01:47.785 --> 01:51.305
I hear someone persuaded His Majesty to issue a decree

7
01:51.945 --> 01:53.625
allowing Noble Lady Wu'an

8
01:54.185 --> 01:56.825
to divorce the heir to the Duke of Ying.

9
01:56.905 --> 01:59.265
Lady Li, the Empress Dowager arranged that marriage herself.

10
01:59.345 --> 02:01.065
Yet you acted without informing her

11
02:01.145 --> 02:02.825
and made the decision on your own.

12
02:03.465 --> 02:05.345
You've overstepped your authority.

13
02:05.425 --> 02:06.905
Your Majesty, allow me to explain.

14
02:07.465 --> 02:08.985
Wu'an made a noble sacrifice

15
02:09.065 --> 02:10.945
and married Lu Zhuo to help him recover.

16
02:11.024 --> 02:14.145
Sadly, their personalities clashed, and the marriage failed.

17
02:14.225 --> 02:16.305
Rather than let them grow to resent each other

18
02:16.385 --> 02:17.625
and fail to appreciate Your Majesty's kindness,

19
02:18.225 --> 02:21.185
it was better to let them part ways.

20
02:21.265 --> 02:23.145
Have you heard the rumors in the capital, Lady Li?

21
02:23.985 --> 02:25.345
People are saying

22
02:25.425 --> 02:27.985
her own mother is a woman of loose morals

23
02:28.065 --> 02:29.985
who pushed her daughter to divorce and remarry.

24
02:30.065 --> 02:30.905
LADY ZHENG

25
02:30.985 --> 02:33.905
They're also spreading gossip about your past.

26
02:34.545 --> 02:35.865
And the things they're saying are truly disgraceful.

27
02:36.705 --> 02:37.585
It's simply

28
02:37.665 --> 02:40.585
a stain on His Majesty's good name and the Imperial Family's honor.

29
02:41.785 --> 02:43.785
Lady Li was only concerned for her daughter.

30
02:43.865 --> 02:44.905
She never meant to defy Your Majesty.

31
02:44.985 --> 02:47.905
Please consider her love as a mother

32
02:47.985 --> 02:49.065
and forgive her offense.

33
02:49.665 --> 02:52.665
What's done is done. Their marriage cannot be saved.

34
02:53.185 --> 02:54.505
Besides, as for the divorce,

35
02:55.145 --> 02:56.665
His Majesty gave his consent.

36
02:57.585 --> 02:58.465
How dare you!

37
02:59.385 --> 03:00.585
His Majesty's lifelong reputation

38
03:00.665 --> 03:02.385
has been ruined by you!

39
03:03.545 --> 03:05.025
Yet you show no remorse.

40
03:05.105 --> 03:07.105
You can't even raise your own daughter properly!

41
03:07.665 --> 03:10.065
Very well. If you can't teach her,

42
03:11.225 --> 03:12.225
I'll do it myself.

43
03:13.145 --> 03:15.185
To put an end to the gossip,

44
03:15.265 --> 03:18.865
find Wu'an another husband at once.

45
03:20.505 --> 03:23.385
Han Liao, heir to the Marquis of Xiting,

46
03:23.465 --> 03:25.945
is a fine warrior who recently lost his wife.

47
03:26.785 --> 03:28.505
He won't mind marrying a divorced woman.

48
03:29.345 --> 03:32.465
She should stay out of the public eye

49
03:32.545 --> 03:34.825
and focus on being a dutiful wife.

50
03:34.905 --> 03:35.825
In time,

51
03:36.425 --> 03:38.745
the rumors will die down.

52
03:44.505 --> 03:46.145
Even the palace rarely sees sea pearls

53
03:46.785 --> 03:48.145
of such fine quality.

54
03:48.825 --> 03:51.225
Lord Han, what is it you want?

55
03:53.585 --> 03:55.425
I wish to marry Lady Wu'an.

56
03:55.505 --> 03:57.745
I humbly ask Your Majesty to grant my request.

57
03:58.345 --> 03:59.625
Absolutely not.

58
04:00.905 --> 04:03.105
No Han shall marry that wretch's daughter!

59
04:03.745 --> 04:04.985
Please calm yourself, Your Majesty.

60
04:05.065 --> 04:05.905
GRACIOUS BLESSINGS

61
04:05.985 --> 04:09.385
Wu'an seized vast estates and lands belonging to my family

62
04:09.465 --> 04:11.065
and humiliated me.

63
04:11.145 --> 04:13.025
Marrying her would return them to us

64
04:13.105 --> 04:16.985
and give us leverage over Lady Li.

65
04:17.705 --> 04:19.985
His Majesty must name a crown prince someday.

66
04:20.064 --> 04:22.145
Please consider what that means.

67
04:24.825 --> 04:27.545
Thank you for caring about my daughter's future, Your Majesty.

68
04:29.865 --> 04:31.025
However, His Majesty has said

69
04:31.665 --> 04:34.305
the annual military competition always draws exceptional talent.

70
04:34.385 --> 04:36.625
He wishes to choose Wu'an's husband himself.

71
04:37.425 --> 04:40.065
If Lord Han is truly such a great warrior,

72
04:40.145 --> 04:41.505
he should have no trouble winning.

73
04:42.105 --> 04:46.385
But this year's competition will be rather unusual.

74
04:46.905 --> 04:48.505
I'm afraid Lord Han

75
04:49.945 --> 04:50.945
may not dare enter.

76
04:53.025 --> 04:54.225
What makes it so unusual?

77
04:54.825 --> 04:58.145
He must first survive the Thousand-Bolt Crossbow Formation.

78
04:58.665 --> 04:59.625
The Thousand-Bolt Crossbow?

79
05:00.225 --> 05:02.185
I hear it's a new weapon from the Imperial Workshop.

80
05:02.265 --> 05:04.305
It can fire thousands of bolts at once.

81
05:04.385 --> 05:05.985
Even heavy shields are shredded within 300 paces.

82
05:06.065 --> 05:07.105
Incredible!

83
05:07.185 --> 05:09.185
This year's competition will be quite a spectacle!

84
05:09.265 --> 05:10.305
Indeed.

85
05:10.385 --> 05:12.105
The competition is usually held at the military camp.

86
05:12.185 --> 05:13.985
But this year, it's been moved to Shanglin Park.

87
05:14.065 --> 05:16.905
Perhaps His Majesty suddenly wants to watch warriors fight,

88
05:17.585 --> 05:19.465
or maybe there's another reason.

89
05:20.625 --> 05:21.825
What other reason could there be?

90
05:22.425 --> 05:25.065
His Majesty plans to inspect the troops during the competition

91
05:25.145 --> 05:26.665
and select the most capable men.

92
05:29.465 --> 05:30.345
Lu Zhuo,

93
05:30.865 --> 05:32.985
you look terribly ill.

94
05:33.065 --> 05:35.625
You mustn't compete again this year.

95
05:35.705 --> 05:38.945
If Lu Zhuo doesn't compete, who will win for the Lu family?

96
05:43.785 --> 05:46.225
Let my second brother have a chance.

97
05:46.305 --> 05:47.625
Brother, do you really mean that?

98
05:48.665 --> 05:51.065
Grandfather, I can do it. Please let me compete.

99
05:56.665 --> 05:58.945
Since your brother has spoken for you,

100
05:59.025 --> 06:00.625
-you may give it a try. -Yes, Grandfather!

101
06:00.705 --> 06:03.785
Remember, your brother went ten years without a single defeat.

102
06:04.305 --> 06:05.465
Don't bring shame upon the Lu family.

103
06:06.265 --> 06:07.985
I won't let you down, Grandfather.

104
06:08.625 --> 06:10.225
Very well. You may go.

105
06:11.265 --> 06:12.305
We take our leave, Grandfather.

106
06:16.465 --> 06:17.505
Well, look at you!

107
06:18.345 --> 06:20.105
I've already found the perfect match for you.

108
06:20.705 --> 06:23.025
Xie Hualou, Grand Tutor Xie's eldest granddaughter,

109
06:23.105 --> 06:24.585
is beautiful, talented, and virtuous.

110
06:24.665 --> 06:27.225
She's more than fit to be the future mistress of this household.

111
06:27.305 --> 06:28.745
I'll send a marriage proposal tomorrow.

112
06:29.385 --> 06:31.705
Lu Zhuo has only just divorced.

113
06:32.425 --> 06:34.465
How can you arrange another marriage so soon?

114
06:34.545 --> 06:35.465
Isn't that terribly hasty?

115
06:35.545 --> 06:38.025
I'm not asking him to marry her tomorrow.

116
06:38.105 --> 06:39.905
We can arrange the engagement first.

117
06:40.425 --> 06:42.225
They can marry in a year or so.

118
06:45.545 --> 06:46.945
Grandfather,

119
06:47.025 --> 06:49.985
I'd like to make my own decision about marriage.

120
06:50.065 --> 06:52.785
Your decision? Lady Xie is both beautiful and talented.

121
06:52.865 --> 06:55.545
She's a hundred times better than that reckless Wei Rao!

122
06:55.625 --> 06:57.345
And you're still pining for her?

123
06:57.425 --> 06:58.905
Has the illness clouded your judgment?

124
06:58.985 --> 07:00.105
You're the one who's lost his senses!

125
07:00.185 --> 07:01.665
You were the one who insisted

126
07:01.745 --> 07:02.985
on arranging his marriage to the Wei family.

127
07:03.065 --> 07:05.025
Now you want him to marry a Xie instead.

128
07:05.105 --> 07:06.945
He's barely divorced,

129
07:07.025 --> 07:08.625
and you're already rushing to find him another wife.

130
07:08.705 --> 07:11.745
What will people say about Lu Zhuo?

131
07:11.825 --> 07:13.465
Haven't you heard the news from the palace?

132
07:13.545 --> 07:14.665
Every family has been told

133
07:14.745 --> 07:16.265
to send its finest unmarried young men to compete.

134
07:16.905 --> 07:18.465
There are no princesses waiting to marry.

135
07:18.545 --> 07:19.545
Who do you think it's for?

136
07:21.145 --> 07:24.025
You mean the palace is choosing a husband for Wei Rao?

137
07:24.105 --> 07:25.745
What Lady Li is doing

138
07:25.825 --> 07:28.025
is a slap in the face to our entire family!

139
07:28.625 --> 07:30.345
They're already choosing a noble husband for her.

140
07:30.865 --> 07:31.985
I'm pushing you to find another wife

141
07:32.065 --> 07:35.705
so you'll finally face reality and stop clinging to false hopes!

142
07:39.985 --> 07:42.505
Lu Zhuo, what are we going to do?

143
07:42.585 --> 07:45.185
Grandmother, we're already divorced.

144
07:45.705 --> 07:47.305
She and I have nothing to do with each other now.

145
07:47.825 --> 07:51.025
Whoever she marries is entirely her choice.

146
07:53.705 --> 07:54.985
What a cruel twist of fate!

147
07:55.505 --> 07:56.625
Fine.

148
07:56.705 --> 07:58.585
Then go and see for yourself,

149
07:58.665 --> 08:01.585
how Lady Wu'an chooses her new husband.

150
08:02.825 --> 08:04.105
Of course I'll go.

151
08:04.625 --> 08:07.105
But only to watch my second brother win.

152
08:08.225 --> 08:10.625
Fine. Very well!

153
08:11.185 --> 08:14.745
You really are as stubborn as they come!

154
08:15.745 --> 08:17.865
Let's see how long you can keep up that act.

155
08:27.905 --> 08:29.665
Princess Consort Duan is known for her virtue.

156
08:29.745 --> 08:31.625
She truly deserves that reputation.

157
08:31.705 --> 08:33.305
Thank goodness she's so sensible.

158
08:33.385 --> 08:35.065
If Lady Chan had made a scene,

159
08:35.144 --> 08:37.185
who knows what rumors would be spreading?

160
08:46.065 --> 08:48.465
My Lady, Lady Li sent me

161
08:49.185 --> 08:50.865
to wait here for you.

162
08:51.985 --> 08:52.865
What's all this?

163
08:53.545 --> 08:56.465
The military competition is in three days at Shanglin Park.

164
08:56.545 --> 08:57.985
You've been invited to attend.

165
09:04.425 --> 09:05.625
ZHUYU ESTATE

166
09:05.705 --> 09:08.545
THREE DAYS LATER

167
09:13.145 --> 09:13.985
Send for Bitao.

168
09:16.505 --> 09:17.545
Yes, My Lady.

169
09:20.105 --> 09:21.425
That girl

170
09:22.105 --> 09:23.665
is far too impulsive.

171
09:30.145 --> 09:30.985
Come here.

172
09:44.785 --> 09:46.625
I'm not used to anyone else doing my hair and makeup.

173
09:47.705 --> 09:49.345
I'd rather you do it from now on.

174
09:54.105 --> 09:55.945
My Lady!

175
09:58.105 --> 09:59.505
There, now.

176
10:00.465 --> 10:02.425
I have a banquet to attend. I can't be late.

177
10:03.025 --> 10:04.065
Come, help me get ready.

178
10:09.945 --> 10:11.705
I'll get you ready, My Lady.

179
10:31.225 --> 10:32.705
ZHUYU ESTATE

180
10:32.785 --> 10:35.305
The bricks, tiles, reeds, and bamboo arrive today.

181
10:35.385 --> 10:36.385
Keep an eye on the silkworm house.

182
10:36.985 --> 10:39.305
My Lady, please let me go with you.

183
10:39.385 --> 10:42.065
No. The estate's work comes first.

184
10:42.145 --> 10:43.465
None of you need to come.

185
10:57.065 --> 10:59.505
LIU SHUO, THE EMPEROR'S FOURTH SON

186
11:00.185 --> 11:01.545
This estate belongs to Lady Wu'an.

187
11:01.625 --> 11:02.865
Outsiders shall not enter.

188
11:02.945 --> 11:05.465
Who are you? You can't just barge in!

189
11:09.625 --> 11:12.025
Why did you run in front of the horse? Do you have a death wish?

190
11:12.105 --> 11:13.505
This is His Highness, the Fourth Prince!

191
11:13.585 --> 11:14.905
Go inform Lady Wu'an at once!

192
11:16.225 --> 11:17.305
Your Highness.

193
11:20.305 --> 11:21.785
My Lady. My… my Lady.

194
11:21.865 --> 11:22.945
I heard.

195
11:35.465 --> 11:36.905
So you're my elder sister.

196
11:37.945 --> 11:38.985
We haven't met before.

197
11:39.065 --> 11:41.425
-I'm… -You're Lady Li's son,

198
11:41.945 --> 11:44.065
His Majesty's beloved Fourth Prince.

199
11:46.705 --> 11:47.865
I traveled the provinces to further my studies.

200
11:47.945 --> 11:49.225
Only returned to the capital two days ago.

201
11:49.305 --> 11:50.265
I've wanted to meet you ever since.

202
11:50.865 --> 11:53.545
But Mother was afraid I'd startle you, so she kept forbidding me to come.

203
11:53.625 --> 11:56.105
But… Today is your first palace banquet, Rao.

204
11:56.185 --> 11:57.705
So I came especially to escort you.

205
11:57.785 --> 11:59.825
I've prepared a carriage. Come, Rao.

206
11:59.905 --> 12:01.465
I have my own carriage.

207
12:01.545 --> 12:02.465
You needn't trouble yourself, Your Highness.

208
12:06.825 --> 12:08.545
Rao! Sister.

209
12:10.025 --> 12:12.025
You don't seem to like me very much.

210
12:12.825 --> 12:13.665
I wouldn't dare.

211
12:13.745 --> 12:15.025
What is it?

212
12:15.105 --> 12:17.585
Are you jealous because Mother has always been by my side?

213
12:17.665 --> 12:19.145
Or are you angry that

214
12:19.225 --> 12:21.665
I haven't visited you all these years?

215
12:22.625 --> 12:24.305
What exactly are you trying to say, Fourth Prince?

216
12:25.225 --> 12:26.985
You'll understand once you enter the palace.

217
12:27.065 --> 12:29.665
It's full of wicked old witches who'd eat kids alive.

218
12:29.745 --> 12:32.105
Mother kept her distance to protect you.

219
12:32.185 --> 12:34.265
After all, from the moment I was born,

220
12:34.345 --> 12:35.345
we've been on the same side.

221
12:38.145 --> 12:39.065
What makes you say that?

222
12:40.025 --> 12:41.385
If Mother and I are doing well,

223
12:41.465 --> 12:43.145
you'll have a good life too.

224
12:43.665 --> 12:46.585
But if Mother and I ever fall, you'll suffer a terrible fate.

225
12:47.185 --> 12:48.305
Our interests are tied together.

226
12:48.385 --> 12:50.145
So you have every reason to be close to me.

227
12:50.225 --> 12:52.705
We should be the very best of friends!

228
12:58.945 --> 13:00.305
Your Highness.

229
13:00.385 --> 13:01.705
No need to be so formal with me.

230
13:01.785 --> 13:02.785
Just call me Shuo from now on.

231
13:03.505 --> 13:06.585
Come, let me help you into the carriage. Here.

232
13:06.665 --> 13:09.585
ZHUYU ESTATE

233
13:10.985 --> 13:11.825
Watch your step.

234
13:20.625 --> 13:21.865
I'll lead the way for you, Rao.

235
13:23.865 --> 13:24.825
Is he…

236
13:26.625 --> 13:29.145
really my own flesh-and-blood brother?

237
13:51.345 --> 13:54.025
Han Liao is incredibly strong and cunning.

238
13:54.105 --> 13:55.025
He often fights dirty.

239
13:56.345 --> 13:58.785
If you face him, be extremely careful.

240
13:59.465 --> 14:00.625
I've trained in martial arts for years.

241
14:00.705 --> 14:02.465
You're underestimating me.

242
14:02.545 --> 14:03.385
Lu Ya.

243
14:41.225 --> 14:42.665
You probably aren't used to gatherings like this.

244
14:43.305 --> 14:45.145
And there are many people you don't know.

245
14:45.225 --> 14:46.345
I'll sit with you for a while.

246
14:46.985 --> 14:48.185
Thank you, Princess Consort Duan.

247
14:53.985 --> 14:56.305
His Majesty is testing the new crossbows this year.

248
14:56.385 --> 14:57.825
All the military officers are eager to compete.

249
14:58.585 --> 15:00.585
Look, even Han Liao has entered.

250
15:11.185 --> 15:12.225
-Bravo! -Bravo!

251
15:12.305 --> 15:14.585
-Well done! -Bravo!

252
15:14.665 --> 15:16.545
-Bravo! -Bravo!

253
15:16.625 --> 15:18.665
-He's taking on three men at once. -Truly remarkable.

254
15:18.745 --> 15:19.585
What an amazing fight.

255
15:19.665 --> 15:21.105
Indeed.

256
15:22.345 --> 15:23.945
Give that to Lady Wu'an.

257
15:24.025 --> 15:25.585
-Hurry. -Yes, My Lord.

258
15:33.585 --> 15:36.665
Lord Han wishes to present today's spoils to Lady Wu'an.

259
15:38.625 --> 15:39.985
He's won more than ten matches today.

260
15:40.705 --> 15:42.785
His reputation as an undefeated general is well deserved.

261
15:43.985 --> 15:46.105
Truly, none can rival him.

262
15:47.745 --> 15:48.665
Quite so.

263
15:48.745 --> 15:50.185
His endurance is astounding.

264
15:50.265 --> 15:53.425
My Lady. General Qi asked me to bring you this fruit platter.

265
16:10.105 --> 16:11.305
Please thank General Qi for me.

266
16:12.425 --> 16:15.065
General Qi and Lord Han are both exceptional warriors.

267
16:15.145 --> 16:18.265
Rao, who do you think will win today?

268
16:18.865 --> 16:20.945
Both generals have their strengths.

269
16:21.025 --> 16:22.385
It's hard to say who will win.

270
16:30.145 --> 16:31.825
His Majesty has arrived!

271
16:51.345 --> 16:53.145
Everyone, rise.

272
16:58.545 --> 17:00.465
Let the competition continue!

273
17:04.585 --> 17:06.305
Rao, forgive me for interfering.

274
17:06.385 --> 17:07.704
Both General Qi and Lord Han

275
17:07.785 --> 17:09.065
are going out of their way to court you.

276
17:09.665 --> 17:12.985
But a woman who entertains two suitors

277
17:13.065 --> 17:14.065
is bound to attract gossip.

278
17:14.665 --> 17:16.625
I suggest you be more careful,

279
17:17.265 --> 17:19.025
lest Lady Li take offense.

280
17:22.545 --> 17:24.665
Rao, come here.

281
17:37.665 --> 17:39.985
May Your Majesty enjoy good health

282
17:40.065 --> 17:41.545
and Your Majesty the Empress Dowager enjoy endless happiness.

283
17:42.505 --> 17:43.745
Your Majesty,

284
17:43.825 --> 17:45.825
look at this young lady.

285
17:46.665 --> 17:48.585
She doesn't look

286
17:48.665 --> 17:50.465
quite like her mother, does she?

287
17:53.625 --> 17:56.825
She looks just as I remember.

288
17:57.585 --> 18:00.065
Beautiful, graceful, and poised.

289
18:01.185 --> 18:02.745
Come, give her a seat.

290
18:04.185 --> 18:05.385
Thank you, Your Majesty.

291
18:10.785 --> 18:12.105
She is Lady Wu'an.

292
18:17.065 --> 18:18.585
Lady Wu'an,

293
18:18.665 --> 18:20.665
so many fine warriors have gathered today.

294
18:21.305 --> 18:24.705
Yet Right General Han Liao stands above them all.

295
18:24.785 --> 18:27.425
Not one man here has been able to defeat him.

296
18:27.505 --> 18:28.945
He's truly an exceptional warrior.

297
18:29.585 --> 18:31.785
What do you think of him?

298
18:31.865 --> 18:34.185
The competition isn't over.

299
18:34.265 --> 18:37.545
How can you be sure Han Liao will emerge victorious?

300
18:40.385 --> 18:41.465
How many matches has he won?

301
18:42.345 --> 18:45.265
Your Majesty, Lord Han has won fifteen straight matches,

302
18:45.345 --> 18:46.545
defeating every challenger.

303
18:46.625 --> 18:48.425
No one else dares enter the arena.

304
18:49.345 --> 18:50.665
It seems we've searched the entire army,

305
18:51.305 --> 18:52.385
Lady Li,

306
18:52.905 --> 18:56.145
and still found no warrior capable of defeating Han Liao.

307
18:57.825 --> 18:58.865
I'll fight him!

308
19:10.745 --> 19:12.025
Shunqin.

309
19:12.105 --> 19:13.945
Has General Qi had too much wine?

310
19:14.025 --> 19:15.185
His legs seem rather unsteady.

311
19:15.785 --> 19:18.785
Or is he simply outmatched and too afraid to fight?

312
19:20.945 --> 19:22.145
There's something wrong with the wine.

313
19:24.225 --> 19:25.345
Help him away first.

314
19:25.425 --> 19:26.545
-Yes, My Lord. -Summon a physician to examine him.

315
19:41.065 --> 19:43.145
I've won every match today!

316
19:43.665 --> 19:47.025
Well? Anyone else think they can beat me?

317
19:49.345 --> 19:52.345
He has no respect for the Lu family!

318
19:52.425 --> 19:54.825
General Han, I'll take you on!

319
19:55.585 --> 19:57.345
Lu Ya, don't be reckless!

320
19:57.425 --> 19:58.785
Who is he?

321
19:58.865 --> 20:01.025
Admirable courage.

322
20:41.105 --> 20:42.065
-How is he? -Help him up!

323
20:42.145 --> 20:43.585
-Help him up! -Oh my.

324
20:46.185 --> 20:48.145
-Sixteen straight victories. -Oh my.

325
20:48.225 --> 20:49.705
Simply unrivaled!

326
20:49.785 --> 20:51.665
-No one's a match for him. -He's unbeatable.

327
20:51.745 --> 20:53.865
-How remarkable. -He has no equal!

328
21:00.705 --> 21:01.865
He can still fight on?

329
21:05.945 --> 21:08.705
Lu Zhuo. Can't you see?

330
21:08.785 --> 21:10.265
He's deliberately provoking you into fighting.

331
21:19.745 --> 21:22.505
Lord Lu, accidents happen in the arena.

332
21:22.585 --> 21:25.225
Forgive me for injuring your brother.

333
21:25.985 --> 21:28.505
I heard your old illness has returned, leaving you too sick to leave home.

334
21:28.585 --> 21:31.385
I suggest you stay out of this.

335
21:31.465 --> 21:33.625
I'd hate to be accused of an unfair victory.

336
21:34.985 --> 21:35.945
After you.

337
21:59.425 --> 22:00.745
Let's see what happens.

338
22:54.905 --> 22:55.945
Watch out!

339
23:21.065 --> 23:24.425
Of the Four Elite Armies, the Shenwu Army is the strongest.

340
23:25.025 --> 23:27.425
For years, the Lu family has held it firmly in their grasp.

341
23:28.225 --> 23:31.465
Even my son and I must tread carefully around them.

342
23:31.545 --> 23:33.345
Are you truly confident

343
23:33.865 --> 23:35.625
you can defeat Lu Zhuo?

344
23:35.705 --> 23:38.145
With Your Majesty's support,

345
23:38.665 --> 23:41.265
killing Lu Zhuo and seizing military command

346
23:41.345 --> 23:43.185
will be child's play.

347
23:44.425 --> 23:47.225
You have crossbows backing you, yet you resort to sneak attacks.

348
23:47.305 --> 23:49.865
Hardly an honorable victory, Lord Han.

349
23:49.945 --> 23:52.105
On the battlefield, victory is all that matters.

350
23:52.705 --> 23:55.585
A defeated man has no right to demand fairness.

351
24:11.025 --> 24:14.105
Your Majesty, is today's competition

352
24:14.185 --> 24:15.825
open only to noble families?

353
24:16.825 --> 24:19.345
Lady Wu'an, Lady Li cares deeply about your future.

354
24:19.425 --> 24:23.105
She hopes to find you a worthy husband among our rising military officers.

355
24:23.625 --> 24:26.625
Don't tell me you'd marry some lowborn soldier

356
24:26.705 --> 24:29.185
and make him your husband.

357
24:30.625 --> 24:33.345
Rao, the Empress is kindly helping you find a husband.

358
24:33.985 --> 24:35.985
With so many warriors competing today,

359
24:36.585 --> 24:38.465
you should choose a true hero.

360
24:39.425 --> 24:41.825
My daughter deserves nothing less.

361
24:42.505 --> 24:46.105
Don't worry. Speak your mind.

362
24:46.825 --> 24:49.265
Your Majesty, choosing my husband is a minor matter.

363
24:49.345 --> 24:51.025
Choosing capable generals matters far more.

364
24:51.105 --> 24:52.865
Neither should depend on noble birth.

365
24:52.945 --> 24:55.545
If nobles can compete, why not commoners?

366
24:56.145 --> 24:58.425
Great generals have always come from noble families.

367
24:58.505 --> 25:01.625
What could an illiterate foot soldier possibly know?

368
25:01.705 --> 25:02.545
How could he command an army?

369
25:02.625 --> 25:05.585
Lady Wu'an lives in seclusion. She knows nothing of state affairs.

370
25:05.665 --> 25:06.865
We can't blame her for that.

371
25:06.945 --> 25:10.345
Lady Wu'an, ignoring rank will only bring chaos.

372
25:10.945 --> 25:13.025
Are you ignorant, or deliberately stirring up trouble?

373
25:13.705 --> 25:16.465
I hear your estate has taken in many scholars.

374
25:16.545 --> 25:17.625
They haven't been recommended for office,

375
25:17.705 --> 25:19.425
nor do they come from military families.

376
25:19.505 --> 25:22.065
Lady Wu'an, you shouldn't let those scholars lead you astray.

377
25:23.065 --> 25:25.185
This is supposed to be a martial arts competition.

378
25:25.265 --> 25:28.105
Victory should depend on skill, not family background.

379
25:28.185 --> 25:30.265
Anyone with exceptional fighting skills

380
25:30.345 --> 25:31.425
could become a valuable officer.

381
25:31.505 --> 25:33.465
That's what a fair competition should be.

382
25:34.305 --> 25:36.865
Do enemy swords and blades

383
25:36.945 --> 25:39.425
distinguish nobles from commoners?

384
26:11.625 --> 26:12.905
Starting tomorrow,

385
26:13.425 --> 26:16.225
all soldiers may enter the competition.

386
26:16.865 --> 26:19.905
Win three matches in a row, and you'll be promoted one rank.

387
26:20.425 --> 26:22.865
The champion will receive a title based on merit.

388
26:23.745 --> 26:27.345
Long live Your Majesty!

389
26:27.425 --> 26:29.065
Now see what the Thousand-Bolt Crossbow can do.

390
26:33.185 --> 26:34.425
Look!

391
26:34.505 --> 26:37.705
How did Lord Han lose so suddenly?

392
26:49.225 --> 26:51.585
Save him! Hurry! Someone help him!

393
26:55.825 --> 26:56.745
Your Majesty!

394
26:56.825 --> 26:58.065
Lu Zhuo used the competition to settle a personal grudge.

395
26:58.145 --> 26:59.905
He deliberately injured Lord Han!

396
26:59.985 --> 27:02.785
I beg Your Majesty to grant the Han family justice

397
27:02.865 --> 27:04.185
and punish the culprit severely!

398
27:04.265 --> 27:07.665
Your Majesty, injuries happen in combat.

399
27:07.745 --> 27:09.825
Lord Lu was injured too.

400
27:09.905 --> 27:13.425
-Everyone saw that he… -Who here actually saw what happened?

401
27:13.505 --> 27:15.465
It was clearly a fair fight.

402
27:15.545 --> 27:17.145
How can you call that deliberate assault?

403
27:17.225 --> 27:19.905
He lost because he wasn't good enough. Who else can he blame?

404
27:20.545 --> 27:23.985
You praised him as the greatest warrior alive.

405
27:24.065 --> 27:27.225
I thought he must be an incredible fighter.

406
27:27.305 --> 27:30.425
Turns out he's not much of one at all.

407
27:30.505 --> 27:34.465
Your Majesty, the Lu and Han families have never been on good terms.

408
27:34.545 --> 27:36.945
Lu Zhuo deliberately injured him.

409
27:37.025 --> 27:38.705
That makes his offense even worse.

410
27:39.425 --> 27:41.985
I beg Your Majesty to judge this fairly.

411
27:50.865 --> 27:53.465
Winning and losing are part of any competition.

412
27:54.825 --> 27:57.585
Accusing him of deliberate assault is utterly groundless.

413
27:58.265 --> 28:00.265
Summon the imperial physicians to treat the injured.

414
28:00.985 --> 28:02.345
Today's competition

415
28:02.865 --> 28:04.225
-will continue as planned. -Yes, Your Majesty.

416
28:17.625 --> 28:18.665
Lord Lu!

417
28:26.265 --> 28:29.465
ZHAO

418
28:36.865 --> 28:37.865
Your Majesty.

419
28:43.585 --> 28:44.505
Are his injuries really that serious?

420
28:46.625 --> 28:49.225
Does he mean Han Liao, or…

421
28:49.745 --> 28:51.025
Rao.

422
28:52.025 --> 28:53.065
Rao.

423
28:57.265 --> 28:58.145
Look.

424
28:58.745 --> 28:59.665
That young man

425
28:59.745 --> 29:02.545
is Li Wei, the third son of the Marquis of Zhennan.

426
29:03.225 --> 29:06.985
He's rather young, and he lacks experience.

427
29:07.065 --> 29:10.305
But his character and looks are exceptional.

428
29:10.385 --> 29:12.745
He's nearly as impressive as Lu Zhuo.

429
29:13.625 --> 29:16.425
Qi Zhongkai is a fine choice too.

430
29:16.505 --> 29:18.665
But his mother is difficult to deal with.

431
29:19.305 --> 29:21.905
Besides, the Qi and Lu families are very close.

432
29:21.985 --> 29:24.265
I'm afraid that would make things awkward.

433
29:28.985 --> 29:30.345
Rao.

434
29:31.705 --> 29:33.945
There's no turning back now.

435
29:48.985 --> 29:50.865
Forgive me, My Lady! It was an accident!

436
29:50.945 --> 29:52.185
How could you be so careless?

437
29:52.785 --> 29:55.145
It's all right. I'll go change and come back.

438
29:56.625 --> 29:58.385
Escort Lady Wu'an to Fanghua Hall.

439
29:58.465 --> 29:59.345
Yes, My Lady.

440
30:07.865 --> 30:10.545
Isn't Juzhi on duty today?

441
30:10.625 --> 30:12.145
I'm worried she may not serve her properly.

442
30:12.225 --> 30:13.585
Go and help her.

443
30:20.825 --> 30:22.705
Where is Lord Lu?

444
30:22.785 --> 30:26.425
My Lady, I believe Lord Lu is being treated at Anfu Hall.

445
30:26.505 --> 30:28.945
That's where injured competitors are usually taken.

446
30:29.025 --> 30:30.185
Lead the way.

447
30:30.265 --> 30:31.105
Yes, My Lady.

448
30:36.865 --> 30:38.225
General Li is truly formidable!

449
30:38.305 --> 30:39.785
He knocked that strongman out with one punch!

450
30:39.865 --> 30:40.985
Indeed!

451
30:41.065 --> 30:42.385
-Look at him! -Lady Li praised him highly.

452
30:42.465 --> 30:44.185
She might even choose him as her son-in-law!

453
30:44.265 --> 30:45.545
-Really? -You insolent fool!

454
30:45.625 --> 30:47.025
What nonsense are you spouting?

455
30:49.065 --> 30:50.105
They're fighting again.

456
30:50.625 --> 30:52.665
-Look. -Where on earth has Lady Wu'an gone?

457
30:59.585 --> 31:01.825
My Lord, your wounds are quite serious.

458
31:01.905 --> 31:03.745
Bear with it. The medicine.

459
31:09.705 --> 31:11.745
CHANGYANG PALACE

460
31:13.505 --> 31:14.465
Lady Wu'an is here to visit the injured.

461
31:20.705 --> 31:21.865
Lu Zhuo!

462
31:30.065 --> 31:30.985
Outside…

463
31:32.305 --> 31:33.705
Has anyone come to see me?

464
31:33.785 --> 31:34.625
My Lord,

465
31:34.705 --> 31:36.545
apart from the messenger His Majesty sent

466
31:36.625 --> 31:37.465
to check on you, no one else has come.

467
31:42.465 --> 31:43.305
My Lord!

468
31:47.585 --> 31:49.385
My Lord, I haven't finished treating you!

469
31:49.465 --> 31:51.185
-My Lord, aren't you getting treated? -My Lord!

470
31:51.265 --> 31:53.505
-My Lord! -Quick! Go after him and bring him back!

471
31:53.585 --> 31:54.425
Yes!

472
32:16.745 --> 32:17.745
How thoughtful of you, My Lady,

473
32:17.825 --> 32:19.545
to still be concerned about me.

474
32:20.145 --> 32:23.025
All my efforts to win you over weren't wasted.

475
32:23.105 --> 32:24.425
I'm not here to see you.

476
32:30.025 --> 32:32.425
Han Liao, what are you trying to do?

477
32:33.025 --> 32:35.505
You can marry me properly and become Lady Han,

478
32:36.345 --> 32:38.425
or be branded an adulteress.

479
32:40.665 --> 32:41.665
The choice is yours.

480
32:46.305 --> 32:47.545
Absurd.

481
32:48.185 --> 32:49.345
Who would believe you?

482
32:50.105 --> 32:52.225
A respectable young lady from a good family

483
32:52.865 --> 32:56.225
having an affair with a womanizer like me?

484
32:56.305 --> 32:57.505
Of course no one would believe it.

485
32:58.905 --> 33:01.065
But your birth mother is a social climber!

486
33:01.145 --> 33:03.265
The women of your Zhou family

487
33:03.345 --> 33:04.785
have reputations far worse than mine!

488
33:09.025 --> 33:10.985
Suppose I open that door right now

489
33:11.665 --> 33:13.745
and tell everyone

490
33:15.625 --> 33:17.265
you had an affair with me,

491
33:17.945 --> 33:19.865
and that's why you divorced Lu Zhuo.

492
33:20.465 --> 33:23.465
Think they'd believe me?

493
33:27.185 --> 33:28.665
So you're saying

494
33:29.785 --> 33:31.945
no matter how hard I try,

495
33:33.545 --> 33:34.785
I could never clear my name.

496
33:37.185 --> 33:40.785
That ruthless ex-husband of yours

497
33:42.905 --> 33:45.825
sent me straight into that crossbow formation.

498
33:46.425 --> 33:50.305
There's barely an inch of me left unhurt.

499
33:54.385 --> 33:56.665
If I hadn't been wearing a chest plate,

500
33:57.425 --> 33:59.345
I'd have died right there.

501
34:02.665 --> 34:03.545
Tell me,

502
34:04.185 --> 34:06.625
if he saw you in my arms right now,

503
34:07.145 --> 34:08.744
what kind of face would he make?

504
34:16.585 --> 34:19.865
They say Lord Han is charming

505
34:20.385 --> 34:21.945
and irresistible to women.

506
34:23.105 --> 34:24.304
I'm not so sure.

507
34:24.905 --> 34:26.784
I'm right here. I'm not going anywhere.

508
34:28.185 --> 34:29.744
Yet you're being so rough.

509
34:30.784 --> 34:32.145
You're hurting me.

510
34:33.145 --> 34:34.505
Let go of me.

511
34:37.705 --> 34:39.865
Don't even think about trying anything.

512
34:39.945 --> 34:44.705
You stepped into this hall today.

513
34:45.705 --> 34:48.105
The rumors will haunt you for life.

514
35:01.145 --> 35:02.305
Lord Lu!

515
35:02.385 --> 35:04.145
You can't leave those wounds untreated!

516
35:04.985 --> 35:06.305
Your clothes are soaked in blood!

517
35:06.945 --> 35:09.185
-How am I supposed to explain this? -Don't follow me.

518
35:19.025 --> 35:20.345
Who's in there?

519
35:27.425 --> 35:29.865
You think you can ruin my reputation and force me to marry you?

520
35:30.545 --> 35:31.705
Then you don't know me at all.

521
35:32.305 --> 35:33.465
If that day ever comes,

522
35:34.105 --> 35:35.945
I'll cut you to pieces first.

523
35:49.985 --> 35:51.545
What are you doing here?

524
35:51.625 --> 35:52.665
I came to change my clothes.

525
35:56.465 --> 35:58.465
This isn't where the ladies change.

526
36:00.625 --> 36:03.305
Wei Rao. You came to see me.

527
36:06.345 --> 36:07.545
You were worried about me.

528
36:10.665 --> 36:12.225
Don't flatter yourself.

529
36:15.105 --> 36:16.625
A clever woman like you

530
36:17.345 --> 36:18.705
actually lost your head

531
36:19.225 --> 36:20.465
and walked right into a trap.

532
36:23.265 --> 36:24.465
You really weren't worried?

533
36:27.065 --> 36:29.145
You fainted on purpose back there? I…

534
36:30.985 --> 36:33.865
Wei Rao, you still have feelings for me.

535
36:38.265 --> 36:39.385
You jerk!

536
36:40.345 --> 36:43.265
I was supposed to take Lady Wu'an to Fanghua Hall to change.

537
36:43.345 --> 36:44.625
But when we got near this place…

538
36:44.705 --> 36:47.825
Lady Wu'an said she'd lost her sachet and sent me to look for it.

539
36:47.905 --> 36:50.265
But when I returned, she was gone.

540
36:50.345 --> 36:51.785
Have you searched the entire area?

541
36:52.385 --> 36:55.185
A grown woman can't just vanish into thin air.

542
36:55.265 --> 36:58.105
This park stretches for miles, with countless buildings.

543
36:58.665 --> 37:00.225
Perhaps she took a wrong turn.

544
37:00.305 --> 37:01.585
I'm sure we'll find her soon.

545
37:02.745 --> 37:05.385
Come. Let's check the west wing

546
37:05.465 --> 37:07.945
and ask if anyone has seen Lady Wu'an.

547
37:14.305 --> 37:15.505
He's still breathing.

548
37:16.105 --> 37:19.425
Her Majesty the Empress and Lady Li have arrived!

549
37:28.625 --> 37:30.105
You're the one who sent him into that crossbow trap.

550
37:30.185 --> 37:31.345
You deal with him.

551
37:31.425 --> 37:32.785
What are you doing?

552
37:34.145 --> 37:35.625
There's a lake outside, and no way out.

553
37:36.185 --> 37:37.465
And you're still laughing?

554
37:39.745 --> 37:40.585
Are you all right?

555
37:44.865 --> 37:45.865
What a performance.

556
37:46.825 --> 37:49.305
I'm just taking a page out of your book, Lady Wu'an.

557
37:53.625 --> 37:55.225
Who's hiding in there?

558
37:55.825 --> 37:57.025
Break down that door!

559
37:57.665 --> 37:59.185
Just tell them I did it.

560
37:59.705 --> 38:00.665
You had nothing to do with it.

561
38:01.345 --> 38:02.825
You're going to take the blame for me?

562
38:02.905 --> 38:03.985
Han Liao and I have been enemies for years.

563
38:04.065 --> 38:05.945
It's already a fight to the death.

564
38:06.025 --> 38:07.185
One more offense won't matter.

565
38:07.905 --> 38:09.425
Her Majesty is here! Open the door!

566
38:09.945 --> 38:11.145
Open up in there!

567
38:13.625 --> 38:14.865
There's no need.

568
38:16.145 --> 38:17.825
I'm hardly some sheltered young lady.

569
38:17.905 --> 38:19.785
Even if I killed that lecher on the spot,

570
38:19.865 --> 38:21.465
he'd have brought it on himself.

571
38:22.065 --> 38:23.905
I'll take responsibility for what I've done.

572
38:25.225 --> 38:26.265
I won't drag anyone else into it.

573
38:30.985 --> 38:31.585
CHANGYANG PALACE

574
38:31.665 --> 38:32.985
Open up in there!

575
38:51.105 --> 38:51.985
Your Majesty.

576
38:52.065 --> 38:53.145
Lady Wu'an?

577
38:54.105 --> 38:55.105
What are you doing here?

578
38:55.785 --> 38:57.865
Rao, are you all right?

579
38:58.505 --> 38:59.825
Did he frighten you?

580
39:00.345 --> 39:01.745
Lord Han is recovering here.

581
39:02.545 --> 39:04.585
Why is there no one attending to him?

582
39:05.385 --> 39:07.145
How could you neglect him like this?

583
39:10.465 --> 39:13.865
Don't be afraid. Mother's here. I'll protect you.

584
39:28.625 --> 39:30.465
Lord Han, Her Majesty is here.

585
39:31.985 --> 39:33.025
Lord Han?

586
39:35.145 --> 39:36.185
Lord Han!

587
39:36.945 --> 39:38.305
Her Majesty is here!

588
39:45.225 --> 39:46.705
Why is Lord Lu here?

589
39:53.265 --> 39:54.625
Lu Zhuo pays respects to Your Majesty

590
39:55.345 --> 39:56.945
and to the ladies of the court.

591
39:57.465 --> 39:58.625
Lord Lu, you're badly wounded.

592
39:58.705 --> 40:00.665
There's no need for formalities.

593
40:00.745 --> 40:02.425
Isn't this Lord Han's room?

594
40:02.505 --> 40:05.545
Well, Lord Han was supposed to be recovering here.

595
40:05.625 --> 40:08.225
For some reason, he's gone. I'll investigate right away.

596
40:14.825 --> 40:16.305
Why has Lady Wu'an come back?

597
40:17.505 --> 40:18.345
I've made myself perfectly clear.

598
40:19.625 --> 40:22.025
We're divorced, and we have nothing to do with each other.

599
40:23.225 --> 40:26.305
My injuries are none of your concern.

600
40:27.625 --> 40:28.625
We should keep our distance.

601
40:29.905 --> 40:31.585
-Keep our distance? -Of course we should!

602
40:32.625 --> 40:35.065
The physician was treating my wounds when you barged in,

603
40:35.825 --> 40:37.705
sent him away, and locked the door.

604
40:38.545 --> 40:39.705
What were you thinking?

605
40:40.465 --> 40:41.625
I told you to leave

606
40:42.345 --> 40:43.585
because I didn't want people thinking

607
40:44.185 --> 40:47.945
you were still pining for your ex-husband.

608
40:48.665 --> 40:50.585
The Lu family has strict standards.

609
40:51.345 --> 40:52.785
Even if you deeply regret the divorce

610
40:53.385 --> 40:54.945
and want us to get back together,

611
40:55.025 --> 40:56.745
I'd have to consult my grandmother first.

612
40:57.345 --> 40:59.425
We can't sneak around behind everyone's backs.

613
41:00.305 --> 41:02.065
Don't accuse me of being heartless.

614
41:02.585 --> 41:03.825
I had to protect my reputation

615
41:03.905 --> 41:05.105
and yours, Lady Wu'an.

616
41:05.625 --> 41:07.065
I had no other choice.

617
41:07.985 --> 41:09.145
Please show some restraint.

618
41:10.225 --> 41:12.785
What? Did I say anything untrue?

619
41:13.385 --> 41:15.505
Didn't you come to check on me?

620
41:16.185 --> 41:17.745
You got furious when I turned you away

621
41:18.585 --> 41:19.985
and smashed everything in the room.

622
41:20.505 --> 41:22.425
The evidence is right before everyone.

623
41:23.825 --> 41:24.705
Are you still going to deny it?

624
41:27.265 --> 41:28.185
Rao.

625
41:28.705 --> 41:30.585
Did you come here specifically to see Lord Lu?

626
41:36.145 --> 41:37.425
The Wei and Lu families

627
41:38.905 --> 41:40.105
have been close for generations.

628
41:40.785 --> 41:43.425
His elders have always treated me kindly.

629
41:44.065 --> 41:46.785
Though Lord Lu and I weren't meant to remain husband and wife,

630
41:46.865 --> 41:48.585
our families' long friendship still matters.

631
41:49.185 --> 41:51.105
He's like an older brother to me, and he's badly hurt.

632
41:51.185 --> 41:52.625
Of course I should come see him.

633
41:53.665 --> 41:56.785
I kept it quiet to avoid gossip.

634
42:00.585 --> 42:02.625
Your Majesty, Lord Han has disappeared.

635
42:15.465 --> 42:16.785
Lu Zhuo.

636
42:18.105 --> 42:19.505
His wound must have reopened.

637
42:20.185 --> 42:21.585
Someone fetch the imperial physician.

638
42:21.665 --> 42:22.945
If Lord Lu's condition worsens,

639
42:23.025 --> 42:24.545
who will take responsibility? Hurry!

640
42:24.625 --> 42:25.985
-Yes, My Lady. -Yes, My Lady.

641
42:26.065 --> 42:28.745
Lord Lu is one of His Majesty's favored officials.

642
42:28.825 --> 42:30.665
Oh, what are we going to do?

643
42:34.345 --> 42:35.745
Please rest and recover, Lord Lu.

644
42:41.465 --> 42:42.305
Your Majesty.

645
42:45.585 --> 42:48.185
Rao, come with me.

646
43:15.825 --> 43:17.665
-Rao, did you… -No.

647
43:20.385 --> 43:23.545
Today, the Empress had someone lure me to a side hall

648
43:23.625 --> 43:25.905
so I'd be alone with Han Liao.

649
43:26.465 --> 43:28.985
She wanted to use my reputation to force me into submission.

650
43:29.745 --> 43:31.265
No wonder she went to such lengths

651
43:31.345 --> 43:32.945
to ask us all there.

652
43:33.985 --> 43:36.025
And we should thank Lu Zhuo

653
43:36.105 --> 43:37.385
for putting things aside and saving you.

654
43:37.465 --> 43:40.305
At least that proves he's a man who takes responsibility.

655
43:40.825 --> 43:42.265
-So do you still have feelings… -No.

656
43:46.465 --> 43:48.465
Whatever we had ended long ago.

657
43:48.545 --> 43:52.465
No. There was never any love between us to begin with.

658
43:54.185 --> 43:56.985
If that's what you say, then Mother believes you.

659
44:00.465 --> 44:01.305
Really?

660
44:03.865 --> 44:04.945
You…

661
44:07.025 --> 44:08.465
You're still laughing.

662
44:18.225 --> 44:19.425
Your Majesty.

663
44:19.505 --> 44:21.665
We found Lord Han in the bushes behind the east wing.

664
44:22.265 --> 44:24.465
He's badly injured and still unconscious.

665
44:24.545 --> 44:26.225
We haven't been able to question him.

666
44:28.745 --> 44:30.505
Lu Zhuo. Wei Rao.

667
44:30.585 --> 44:32.225
You've gone too far!

668
44:32.745 --> 44:34.505
What does Your Majesty intend to do?

669
44:35.385 --> 44:37.345
His Majesty keeps protecting that woman.

670
44:37.425 --> 44:39.265
I can't touch that wretch.

671
44:39.345 --> 44:42.905
But surely I can deal with her little brat.

672
44:44.065 --> 44:47.745
Lu Zhuo wiped out the bandits on South Mountain.

673
44:50.505 --> 44:52.105
Those bandits

674
44:52.705 --> 44:55.625
have plagued the court for years.

675
44:56.305 --> 44:58.465
Surely a few escaped

676
44:58.545 --> 45:01.505
and came seeking revenge against Lady Wu'an.

677
45:02.225 --> 45:03.785
A brilliant plan, Your Majesty.

678
45:14.745 --> 45:16.345
Rao, you barely ate at the banquet.

679
45:17.065 --> 45:19.305
Mother specifically asked me to bring you some pastries

680
45:19.905 --> 45:21.425
for the ride home. Here.

681
45:27.625 --> 45:28.705
Today must have frightened you, Rao.

682
45:29.305 --> 45:30.265
Don't worry.

683
45:30.345 --> 45:31.905
The palace is full of schemes and backstabbing.

684
45:31.985 --> 45:33.265
You'll get used to it.

685
45:34.905 --> 45:37.785
I never could. I'd rather go home.

686
45:38.385 --> 45:39.945
I really envy you, Rao.

687
45:40.025 --> 45:41.585
At least you have a home to return to.

688
45:41.665 --> 45:44.185
As for me, the palace is my only home.

689
45:47.985 --> 45:49.985
Rao, someone's here to pick you up!

690
45:54.865 --> 45:55.785
Stop the carriage!

691
46:05.305 --> 46:07.625
My Lady, you were gone so long, I've come to welcome you home.

692
46:07.705 --> 46:09.345
What's so urgent?

693
46:09.425 --> 46:11.545
The silkworm house has been fully thatched.

694
46:11.625 --> 46:13.865
We're all waiting for you to return. By custom,

695
46:13.945 --> 46:15.945
the owner must be the first to enter a newly built house.

696
46:19.705 --> 46:20.905
Watch out!

697
48:37.105 --> 48:39.825
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
